{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）上午10時29分，警方接報一輛七人車在飛鵝山扎山道翻側。據報車上3人已爬出車外等候協助。救援人員到場，涉事七人車反轉，四輪朝天，其中一名男乘客手部受傷，由救護員為他包紮；警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"七人車反轉路中，消防員在場處理。（讀者郭先生提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155116116587319296524037.jpeg/Nx9w3R5ypavhHqZ9IEzQ-XiWlODseUiAPv-quz7_qrs\"/><figcaption>七人車反轉路中，消防員在場處理。（讀者郭先生提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事七人車四輪朝天。（讀者郭先生提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155116114297098240637241.jpeg/O-IaXDG2pnYNIUFNOYj8Px1M_jGlzxe-H02wsh9NsLI\"/><figcaption>涉事七人車四輪朝天。（讀者郭先生提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事七人車四輪朝天。（讀者郭先生提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155116103035260928967504.jpeg/ZWI1z9-tyd887gre6dHPTMvzIw9hcKbRf5v0bX-b9G0\"/><figcaption>涉事七人車四輪朝天。（讀者郭先生提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者登上救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155110054605754368472095.jpeg/x3hV9Qs_yFLjBQ5HoOv0RqhdWbNFX7c2aWR54kxkeeI\"/><figcaption>傷者登上救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155110051594113024683129.jpeg/RNOB7Rtx6y2HnHQDDUOVXSpf1fVrtKAPrBaPvokWj74\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T03:58:23.370647+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}